  "description": "**VIDEO TOUR AVAILABLE ON REQUEST**\n\n**Please note:** Due to privacy considerations, only a limited number of photographs are included in this advertisement. A full video tour of the property can be provided by link upon request to give prospective tenants a more comprehensive view of the house and its features.\n\n**Luxury A-Rated 3-Bedroom Home – Spring View, Gorey**\n\nBeautifully presented, fully furnished 3-bedroom, 3-bathroom home in the sought-after Spring View development in Gorey. This A-rated property offers high-quality, comfortable living with underfloor heating and an air-to-air heat pump, serviced in September 2026.\n\nThe property includes one ensuite bedroom, built-in wardrobes in all bedrooms, and a spacious living area furnished with bespoke furniture and a three-seat electric reclining suite. The living room also features a large electronic projector screen with remote control, providing an excellent setup for home entertainment. The modern kitchen is equipped with a fridge, dishwasher and washing machine. There is also a separate dedicated utility/laundry room, providing a convenient space for laundry and household storage.\n\nOutside, the property benefits from a private rear garden, garden shed and two dedicated parking spaces, providing excellent convenience and additional storage.\n\nThe property is conveniently located close to a wide selection of schools and educational facilities in Gorey and the surrounding area, including St Joseph's Primary School, Bunscoil Loreto, Gorey Central School, Gorey Educate Together National School, Gaelscoil Mhoshiológ, Gorey Community School, Creagh College and Gorey Educate Together Secondary School.\n\nThis is a high-quality, energy-efficient home, offered fully furnished and presented in excellent condition.\n\n**Enquiries by email only.** Please include your full name, number of occupants and preferred tenancy start date when making an enquiry. Please provide any other relevant information you wish to include with your application.\n",
